{"id": "AS-CG-0001", "level": "Critical", "category": "code-generation", "asset": "mes-sql", "statement": "mes-sql 端点生成的 SQL 必须为只读查询：以 SELECT 或 WITH 开头，且不得包含 INSERT/UPDATE/DELETE/MERGE/DDL 关键字；违反者被 SqlSafetyValidator 拦截为 BLOCKED，不得执行", "evidence": {"endpoint": "/v1/ai/mes-sql", "validator": "SqlSafetyValidator", "must_start_with": ["SELECT", "WITH"], "forbidden_ops": ["INSERT", "UPDATE", "DELETE", "MERGE", "DROP", "CREATE", "ALTER", "TRUNCATE"], "expect": "BLOCKED_on_violation"}, "source": "feature-contract", "task_no": "REQ-MES-AI-20260716-001"}
